        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Massimo Giordano, Marcello Giordani, Anna Netrebko\n- Places: Pompei, Metropolitan City of Naples, Italy\n- Roles: operatic tenor\n- Topics: bel canto repertoire, 2009 tour, UNESCO World Heritage Sites\n\nFacts:\n- Massimo Giordano was born on 19 February 1971.\n- Massimo Giordano was born in Pompei, Italy, into an Italian working-class family.\n- Pompei is a city and comune in the Metropolitan City of Naples in Italy.\n- Pompei is home to ancient Roman ruins that are part of UNESCO World Heritage Sites.\n- Massimo Giordano is an Italian-born operatic tenor known for his bel canto repertoire.\n- In 2009, Massimo Giordano toured with Anna Netrebko.\n- A page about Marcello Giordani notes that he should not be confused with the Italian tenor Massimo Giordano.",
